  <figcaption id="vpg-diagram-caption" class="vpg-diagram__caption">
    <p class="vpg-diagram__head">
      <span class="vpg-diagram__fig">Fig 1</span>
      <span class="vpg-diagram__title">驗印閘門</span>
    </p>
    <p class="vpg-diagram__hint" data-vpg-hint hidden>
      選一個情境，看零件依步驟動作；播放中改按其他情境會從頭開始。
    </p>
    <div class="vpg-diagram__live" aria-live="polite">
      <dl class="vpg-diagram__readout">
        <div class="vpg-diagram__reading">
          <dt>有效 token</dt>
          <dd data-readout="activeToken">{start.readout.activeToken}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="vpg-diagram__reading">
          <dt>租約剩餘</dt>
          <dd data-readout="leaseRemaining">{start.readout.leaseRemaining}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="vpg-diagram__reading">
          <dt>active asset</dt>
          <dd data-readout="activeAssetId">{start.readout.activeAssetId}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="vpg-diagram__reading">
          <dt>收據</dt>
          <dd data-readout="receipt">{start.readout.receipt}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="vpg-diagram__note" data-vpg-note>{staticNote}</p>
    </div>
    <p class="vpg-diagram__legend">
      後方輸送臂是 worker A、前方是 worker B；匣蓋的方框是 generation
      戳記，圓點數是 attempt。刻度盤指針指向持有效 token
      的那條臂，內圈弧是租約剩餘；撥桿倒向哪條臂，那條臂的產物就是 active
      asset。
    </p>
